                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I'm surprised game a about bright neon segments managed to get more emotions out of me than some games with mocap animations. Especially in the epilogue, where they suddenly show signs of character with their final animations.\n\nThe music is nice and the epilogue felt joyful at first when (spoiler alert) you get to gather all 5 colorful segment things to travel together but then they eventually get free from the path, reach their ultimate goal and leave your white segment alone.\n\nPuzzle design and difficulty also felt just right to me.",
